Type: project
Package: paytrends
Title: U.S. Pay & Hiring Trends Dashboard
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: person("Jiaqi", "He", email = "Scarlett_hjq@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shiny dashboard and reproducible data pipeline tracking offered
    salaries by role, seniority, employer and location (U.S. DOL LCA
    disclosure data, 2019 to now) alongside market-wide hiring demand
    (Indeed Hiring Lab, BLS JOLTS).
